codespell's dictionaries, the files codespell_lib/data/dictionary*.txt in
/usr/local/lib/codespell, are derivative works of English Wikipedia. They
are the codespell project's improved version of the list of common
misspellings that Wikipedia contributors maintain at
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Lists_of_common_misspellings/For_machines

The codespell project releases them under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License (CC BY-SA 3.0). The license text
is in the file CC-BY-SA-3.0 next to this one and at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/.
